  "markscheme": {
    "html": "<section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"a\"><p><strong>a</strong></p><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"U = \\frac{3}{2}PV\"></span><br/><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"U = 1.5 \\times (2.0 \\times 10^5) \\times (5.0 \\times 10^{-4}) = 150\"></span> «J»<br/>[1 mark]</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"b\"><p><strong>b</strong></p><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"W = P\\Delta V = 2.0 \\times 10^5 \\times (10.0 \\times 10^{-4} - 5.0 \\times 10^{-4})\"></span><br/><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"W = 100\"></span> «J»<br/>[1 mark]</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"c\"><p><strong>c</strong></p><p>For an isothermal process, <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"PV = \\text{constant}\"></span> <strong>OR</strong> <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"P_Y V_Y = P_Z V_Z\"></span> [1 mark]</p>\n<p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"P_Z = \\frac{2.0 \\times 10^5 \\times 10.0 \\times 10^{-4}}{25.0 \\times 10^{-4}} = 8.0 \\times 10^4\"></span> «Pa» <strong>OR</strong> <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.80 \\times 10^5\"></span> «Pa» [1 mark]</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"d\"><p><strong>d</strong></p><p>The change in internal energy is zero / <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\Delta U = 0\"></span> [1 mark]</p>\n<p>Internal energy of an ideal gas depends only on its absolute temperature <strong>OR</strong> since it is isothermal, the temperature is constant, so kinetic energy of molecules is constant [1 mark]</p></section>"
